        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ivar Offset Door Handle - 24 Inch - Satin Stainless Steel</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ivar 24 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Door Offset Handle is a great store door pull. It's easy to clean shape and durable stainless steel construction makes it ideal for high traffic areas. The Ivar Offset Door Handle is easy to install and is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back to back mounting. This Offset Satin Stainless Round Pull has 24 inch mounting centers and is 25-1/4 inches in overall length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/ivar-12-inch-satin-stainless-steel-door-offset-handle\"><b>12 Ivar Inch Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/ivar-36-inch-satin-stainless-steel-door-offset-handle\"><b>36 Ivar Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Offset Doorware Designs RDOPULL24-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 25-1/4\" (642mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24\" (610mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable round rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RDOPULL24-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RDOPULL24 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
